WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Discounts are NOT applied automatically: you must apply to the council. You live alone, or the other adults do not count: 25% off (single person discount). If everyone in the home is a full-time student, nothing is paid.

2
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:27.400
Low income or benefits: «Council Tax Reduction», which can be up to 100%. It counts as a public fund: you cannot claim it with NRPF.

3
00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:34.600
Now do the lesson exercises. If you are unsure, watch this video again.
